+### Debug Log References
+
+- Gleam `let`-binding line-continuation: a statement line starting with `(`
+  CONTINUES the previous `let expr` as a function call — bind comparisons to
+  names first.
+- `|>` binds tighter than `<` in this gleam version — parenthesize or bind.
+- The `type X` import prefix is per-item (only the item it prefixes).
+
+
+### Debug Log References
+
+- The RC4.1 §8.1 contract as merged cannot express two AC-mandated states:
+  "Form opened" (no form-open marker in the payload — the attempts log records
+  sends only) and the received timestamp (neither the attempts log nor the
+  stored result carries the completion instant). Two additive nullable keys
+  (`form_opened_at`, `submitted_at`) shipped expand-only (encoder nullable,
+  decoder `optional_field` back-compat — old payloads still decode; the RC4.1
+  strip assertions untouched). No migration needed (columns exist since rc2-1).
+- The `++` + list-literal combo is a PARSER REJECTION in gleam 1.15.1
+  ("This operator has no value on its right side" — probe-verified in
+  isolation; the codebase never uses `++ [` because of it). Use
+  `list.append` / spread. New field-note candidate.
+- Squirrel regen churned `ai/sql.gleam` (whitespace) + a `pog.array` hunk in
+  `application/sql.gleam` — reverted; `gleam format` restored the canonical
+  hunk shape.
+- Apostrophe serialization (`&#39;`) bit 5 test assertions — assert the escaped
+  form per the 2026-08-03 field note.
+- `list.last` returns Result (not Option) in this stdlib version.
+- `list.filter_map` needs Result (not Option) — wrap with Ok/Error.
+- The `type X` import prefix applies per-item (only the item it prefixes); a
+  bare name import brings the VALUE (constructor) — use module-qualified
+  constructors + `type X` imports in tests.
+- `decode.dict` fails on JSON arrays (they decode as `List(Dynamic)`) — the
+  free-text array needed a `decode.list` branch in the value renderer.
+- `list.all([])` is vacuously True — the panel sub-line checked emptiness
+  FIRST or the pre-trigger panel read "All references closed".
